### Day 7-2 날씨 앱 스타일 구성

![스크린샷 2022-06-07 시간: 02.22.49.png](/images/posts/react-native-basic/%E1%84%89%E1%85%B3%E1%84%8F%E1%85%B3%E1%84%85%E1%85%B5%E1%86%AB%E1%84%89%E1%85%A3%E1%86%BA_2022-06-07_%E1%84%89%E1%85%B5%E1%84%80%E1%85%A1%E1%86%AB_02.22.49%201.png)

